<title>JAPAN: Chugoku Marine corrects 96/97 group current profit.</title>
<headline>Chugoku Marine corrects 96/97 group current profit.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chugoku Marine Paints Ltd on Tuesday corrected its group current profit for the year to March 31, 1997 to 1.08 billion yen, versus 998 million yen announced on May 30.</p>
</text>
